><b><a href=\"/page/Glass\" title=\"Glass\">Glass</a>:</b> Items made of <b>glass</b> are immune to damage from contact with ooze.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0000000005</span>5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">cp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Copper Piece</a></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">0.05 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a></b>, Turn in 100 silver <a href=\"/page/Doubloons\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doubloons\">doubloons</a> at <a href=\"/page/Euphonia%27s_Barter_Box\" title=\"Euphonia&#39;s Barter Box\">Euphonia's Barter Box</a>,\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li>Special: Casts <a href=\"/page/Slay_Living\" title=\"Slay Living\">Slay Living</a> at caster level 10.</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Jolly_Roger_Bomb.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Jolly_Roger_Bomb.png/420px-Jolly_Roger_Bomb.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"402\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Jolly_Roger_Bomb.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>A glass flask filled with a dark gas. When it breaks on impact, nearby enemies are subjected to a Slay Living effect. (<b>Slays any living enemy</b> or deals <b>12 to 18 damage</b> on a successful Fortitude save.</i>\n<p><i>D&amp;D Dice: Slay a living enemy of deals 3d3+9 damage on a successful Fort save.)</i>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816161320\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.130 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2639/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16069/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2706/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n165.51%  192.492     31 Template:IO\n100.00%  116.305      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  116.305      1 -total\n 95.64%  111.238      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 58.58%   68.127      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 57.53%   66.908      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 54.59%   63.490      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 52.87%   61.494      2 Template:InCategory\n 15.88%   18.472 